- Performs real WinHTTP GET and POST requests to .onion services via a Tor SOCKS5 proxy (no tor2web), using WinHTTP's "socks=" proxy syntax.
- Downloads and parses the Tor consensus (extracts valid-after/fresh-until/valid-until and a subset of router entries).
