Below is a complete, runnable Flask app that you can deploy (Render, Railway, Fly.io, Heroku, etc.) and embed on your Square.com site via an iframe. It provides:

- A working /embed route with a compact UI for pasting recipe text or uploading .txt/.pdf files
- Ingredient extraction and external lookups (Wikipedia, Wikidata, Datamuse) with timeouts and error handling
- A playful spell generator using the extracted ingredients and lookup info
- Clear error states and a self-contained HTML/CSS layout suitable for iframes

How to embed on Square:
