Notes
- syn v2 parsing: parse_macro_input!(attr as AttributeArgs) is the correct, stable way to get AttributeArgs. We then validate and convert to our Args type, returning syn::Error on problems.
- No panics: All failures return compiler diagnostics using proc-macro-error’s emit_error!/abort! helpers, producing user-friendly errors instead of panicking.
- You can remove proc-macro-error and instead return TokenStream::from(syn::Error::new(...).to_compile_error()) if you prefer not to depend on it.

