This guide builds a simple, performant 2D solar system visualization on HTML Canvas and shows exactly how to fetch/parse NASA/JPL data (semimajor axes, orbital periods, radii) and map them into code (distance scaling, animation speeds).

Data sources (NASA/JPL)
